OL,3,A'Real life ghost story' inspires new TV
OL,4,Adrama in Welsh countryside
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe "real-life ghost story" of a family
OL,7,Fwho experienced "frightening,
OL,8,Finexplicable" things after moving to
OL,9,Fthe countryside has been turned into a
OL,10,Fnew TV drama.
OL,12,FThe Witch Farm tells the "truly
OL,13,Fnightmarish" tale of Liz and Bill Rich
OL,14,Fwho left London with their son Jonathan
OL,15,Ffor a remote farmhouse in the foothills
OL,16,Fof the Brecon Beacons, determined to
OL,17,Fmake a fresh start.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
